{{!
    The template of the text of the common mail (letter/mail_text.mustache), rendered by compose::render(), not by
    the renderer of Moodle: it is a mail, not a page.

    The plain text of the common e-mail, with the same words as the HTML (mail_letter.mustache) and in the same order: spam
    filters compare both, and some readers only see this one. Plain text, so nothing is escaped. Every address is
    written out after its words. The same context as mail.mustache.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "brand": {"name": "Colegio Los Arces", "unit": "Secretaría", "site": "losarces.example",
            "siteurl": "https://losarces.example"},
        "heading": "Un número se ha unido a tu cuenta", "hello": "Hola, Marta:",
        "blocks": [
            {"paragraph": "Desde hoy, los avisos de la plataforma también te llegan a este número."},
            {"rich": [{"run": "Lo ha añadido "}, {"run": "Marta Ruiz", "bold": true}, {"run": "."}]},
            {"data": [{"label": "Número", "value": "+34 600 000 412"}]},
            {"action": {"actionurl": "https://losarces.example/avisos", "actiontext": "Ver mis avisos"} }
        ],
        "signature": {"signoff": "Un saludo,", "signer": "Secretaría", "signrole": "Colegio Los Arces"},
        "contact": "Calle de los Arces 14, Valle Alto", "reason": "Te llega porque tienes cuenta en la plataforma.",
        "unsub": {"unsuburl": "https://losarces.example/baja", "unsubtext": "Darme de baja",
            "unsubhint": "¿Prefieres no recibir estos correos?"}
    }
}}
